WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.880
I have a feeling that if Democrats don't win back the House, they're going to tell their

00:00:03.880 --> 00:00:06.460
base that ICE rigged the vote.

00:00:06.460 --> 00:00:09.200
To them, nothing matters anymore.

00:00:09.200 --> 00:00:13.800
Senators are still backing a guy who said he wants to put two bullets in Republicans'

00:00:13.800 --> 00:00:14.080
heads.

